                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.6712A/10: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Turkey</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Grew</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-04-16T13:00:00+02:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 16,
                                1928—1 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received April 16—9:10
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>56. My 53, April 14, 1 p.m.<anchor n="10" xml:id="d775-f1"/> Appointment made
                    with the Minister for Foreign Affairs at Angora, Thursday, April 19, 4 p.m.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
